# LifePRO Product Book (canonical manual)

**Location:** `docs/Product (1).pdf`

**Title:** LifePRO User Guide and Field Description Manual — **Product Book** (Version 14, 1714 pages)

Use this file for LifePRO product setup, segment definitions (TYPE_CODE / Product Usage), and hierarchy trace guidance (`PPRDF → PCOMP → PCOVR → PCOVRSGT → PSEGT → rates`).

Prior research referenced this as `Product.pdf`; that alias means **`docs/Product (1).pdf`** in this repo.

